  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Jurassic Redheads</h1>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='row'>\n    <div class='col-sm-8 col-print-12'>\n        <p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: along and across heys</h2>\n      <p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/62\">Carol Ormand</a></strong></p>\n      <p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors start an along the set full hey - ____ on ends, ____ in center || pass neighbor right,   <u>gyre</u> next left, pass neighbor right,   <u>gyre</u> previous neighbor left</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors allemande right ½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons pass by right shoulders</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>12</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">right left through</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles chain</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a full hey - rights in center, lefts on ends, and look up and down for next ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>retrieved from: <a href=\"https://www.cambridgefolk.org.uk/contra/dances/carol_ormand/jurassic_redheads.html\">https://www.cambridgefolk.org.uk/contra/dances/carol_ormand/jurassic_redheads.html</a></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n    </div>\n    <div class='col-sm-4 hidden-print'>\n      <div class='panel panel-default'>\n        <div class=\"panel-heading\">\n          <h2 class='panel-title'>Database</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class='panel-body'>\n          <p class=\"dance-show-user\">user: <a href=\"/users/10\">Allison Jonjak</a></p>\n          <p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>"
